theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("3_hve3p")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 24
text = "Well...

The fact that you did well this first night surpass my expectation (or maybe you did not, but there is no way I'll know since this is a pre-recorded text (laugh)

Anyway, from now on there are several things you can purchase. which I think would be helpful for your stay here, although you have to find their effectiveness on your own...

Anyway, this is the last time you'll heard from me, since the next time I showed here,  you might already be dead. So, HAVE FUN <3"
horizontal_alignment = 1

